3. **Medium — The separate exact-peer poll is still fail-fast on a transient inventory error.** `.apnea/artifacts/plan.md:438` correctly begins only after host classification and checks the exact host PID, but `peer_inventory || return 1` aborts the bounded poll on one transient `lsof`/inventory failure. Make individual inventory failures non-terminal and continue bounded polling; still succeed only when that exact host PID owns exactly one peer, with unrelated peers ignored.
